# Whippoorwill's "damage that would be dealt to that creature this turn can't be ... dealt instead to another permanent or
# player" (CR 614.9), with the controller's own creature as the target: Bot1 activates it targeting Whippoorwill itself. Bot2
# then bolts Whippoorwill; in response Bot1 activates Jade Monolith ("the next time a source of your choice would deal damage to
# target creature this turn, that source deals that damage to you instead") on it, choosing the Bolt. The redirection does
# nothing: Whippoorwill is dealt the 3 and Bot1 none, and as it dies its own delayed ability exiles it (CR 603.7c, 400.7e).

